<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Votre code de vérification AigleSend</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --cerulean: #09adca;
            --aztec: #091418;
            --tarawera: #07404b;
            --blizzard-blue: #a0dce9;
            --mosque: #066071;
            --blue-chill: #08879e;
            --iceberg: #dcf1f4;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            color: #091418;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(9, 20, 24, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #07404b;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo-img {
            max-width: 180px;
            height: auto;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .greeting {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #07404b;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .message {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #4a5568;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .otp-code {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            color: #09adca;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border: 2px dashed #09adca;
        }

        .info-box {
            background-color: #dcf1f4;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #066071;
            border-left: 4px solid #08879e;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: #091418;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #a0dce9;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-container {
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 0;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            .greeting {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dskfw5taz/image/upload/v1758212299/logo_aigle.22a46313_wa20fk.png" alt="AigleSend Logo" class="logo-img">
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">
                Code de vérification
            </div>

            <div class="message">
                Utilisez le code ci-dessous pour valider votre action sur AigleSend.
            </div>

            <div class="otp-code">
                {{ code }}
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Note de sécurité :</strong> Ce code est valable pendant {{ expiresAt }} minutes. Ne le partagez jamais avec qui que ce soit.
            </div>

            <div class="message" style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7; padding-top: 20px;">
                Cordialement,<br>
                <strong>L'équipe AigleSend</strong>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Cet e-mail automatique a été envoyé par AigleSend.</p>
            <p>&copy; {{ new Date().getFullYear() }} AigleSend. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
